# Source of truth for the we-are-mono/ASK commit(s) this repo builds
# against. ASK_REPO is shared; the kernel-patch side and the OOT
# module/userspace side are pinned SEPARATELY below.
#
# History: this repo originally had the kernel side on ASK's now-deleted
# `fix/security-hardening` branch while modules/userspace were pinned to
# `mt-6.12.y` @ a211ea8 -- two different, un-cross-checked refs (see
# plans/enumerated-forging-pie.md finding #1). On 2026-09-11 both were
# bumped together to 5d96de36 (the commit then-live on we-are-mono/
# openwrt's `mono` branch) on the theory that kernel + modules + userspace
# should always move in lockstep. The kernel-patch side validated cleanly
# (Phase 2 of the plan above: full scratch-repo replay + real CI kernel
# build, 0 failures). The OOT module side did NOT: hardware-booted on the
# real DUT the same day and found cdx.ko's built .ko missing the
# comcerto_fpp_send_command / comcerto_fpp_register_event_cb symbols
# EXPORT_SYMBOL'd in cdx_cmdhandler.c (present in the 5d96de36 source,
# absent from `nm` on the actual built module) -- fci.ko then fails to
# load ("Unknown symbol", err -2), cmm crash-loops on `fci_open()`
# failing, and cdx.ko cycles insert/remove continuously, leaking FMan PCD
# hardware state each cycle (observed: FM_PCD NetEnvCharacteristicsSet
# hitting NXP's hard cap of 22 and erroring, still climbing when stopped).
# a211ea8 was the last commit with this exact module/userspace stack
# hardware-validated working (cdx.ko/fci.ko/cmm bridge offload -- see
# kernel/common/scripts/stage-kernel.sh's own "M2 complete" / "bridge
# offload breakthrough" history). Reverted ONLY the modules/userspace pin
# back to it; the kernel-patch pin stays on 5d96de36. This is an ASK-side
# inconsistency between the two commits, not something fixable from here --
# re-evaluate a single shared pin again once a future ASK commit is
# verified compatible on BOTH sides.
ASK_REPO=https://github.com/we-are-mono/ASK.git
ASK_VERSION=5d96de360d8ec7809d8b97cee0ad591e48c5e73e
ASK_MODULES_VERSION=a211ea865379362058c6656b9c448e4a7050e93c
